  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Comparisons eligible for the review of parallel testing in adults and adolescents with HIV. For each comparison, the table gives index test A (respiratory LC-aNAAT plus urinary LF-LAM), the comparator index test B, and the test data required when individual participant data are or are not available.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
